    "title": "USMNT Advances to Gold Cup Final After Defeating Guatemala",
    "text": "Trending Story\nUpdated 03:57 AM UTC, Thu July 3, 2025\nUSMNT Advances to Gold Cup Final After Defeating Guatemala\nSportsLine's Martin Green reveals his prediction and analysis for Wednesday's Concacaf Gold Cup semifinal matchup featuring USMNT vs. Guatemala\nHerculez Gomez\n\"I’m hoping internally he feels pride. He feels like he’s in debt with the federation, with the fanbase, and I think a lot of that, why you saw that emotion, is because now he’s taken it personally.\"\nMartin Green\n\"This is by no means a vintage USMNT team, as so many key players are missing, but they should still have enough quality to beat Guatemala.\"",
